['A hybrid result ranks well for paraphrases but loses exact codes. What should be segmented?','Query-type performance','Only the mean output length','Only provider response color','Only the number of UI buttons','Separate query categories can reveal tradeoffs hidden by an aggregate.','Length does not measure retrieval success.','Color is unrelated.','Buttons do not define ranking quality.'],
['The fixture ranks delivery-policy first. What is verified?','The declared fusion arithmetic','Actual customer relevance','Current policy applicability','A live index’s latency','The local result follows the supplied rankings and formula only.','No users or labels are evaluated.','Source currency is not checked.','No index is queried.']
